message: >-
  Cite this repository as the code and data archive accompanying the
  manuscript. The attribution below identifies the publishing GitHub account;
  the confirmed manuscript author list belongs to the paper itself. No
  journal DOI is asserted here.
type: software
title: >-
  Six-Dimension Complete Coding Agent for Chinese Clinical Free Text to OMOP
  Standard Concepts (面向 OHDSI/OMOP 的中文临床文本概念编码：一种六维完整编码的智能体方法)
authors:
  - name: raywong2121
repository-code: https://github.com/raywong2121/agentsforEHR
url: https://github.com/raywong2121/agentsforEHR
abstract: >-
  Research code and evaluation data for coding Chinese clinical free text into
  OMOP standard concepts as six-attribute records (concept, assertion/time,
  value, specimen, subject, anatomic site). Pipeline: model extraction,
  dual-path vocabulary retrieval (ICD10CN Maps-to bridge + English
  name/synonym search), bounded reformulation, selection or explicit
  abstention, self-verification with one correction cycle, deterministic
  checks, and strategy-level memory with human approval gates. Evaluation:
  100 synthetic cases / 1,013 facts, six-dimension scoring with Wilson
  intervals, zero-shot baseline, AI-adjudicated gold (independent clinician
  spot-check pending).
keywords:
  - OHDSI
  - OMOP CDM
  - clinical natural language processing
  - concept mapping
  - Chinese clinical text
  - agentic coding
  - six-dimension evaluation
